WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:07.955
Nke mbụ, n'ime ndụ na kọmputa, ọgụgụ isi na-arịgo n'ọkwa itoolu site n'otu mgbaàmà na-emeghachi ugboro ugboro.

2
00:00:08.295 --> 00:00:19.339
Nke abụọ, AI nke oge a na-akwụsị n'ọkwa nke ise, iji ngwá ọrụ eme ihe, n'ihi na ọrụ ndị a na-emebu na-akpọte ụdị ndị buru ibu site na ncha.

3
00:00:19.679 --> 00:00:28.463
Nke atọ, ịnakọta azịza ndị e nyochachara n'ime ihe ndị na-eme ka ike dị ala gafere mgbidi ahụ ma kpọghee nzọụkwụ anọ kachasị elu.
